    //
    // Only the non-finite spellings are handled here; everything else still goes
    // to parseFloat, so float("1.5abc") is still the prefix parse 1.5 where CPython
    // raises ValueError. That is a separate, pre-existing looseness and is recorded
    // as such rather than silently half-fixed.
    //
    // Infinity has to be BUILT, not written: the ABNF script dialect has no
    // exponent form in a numeric literal (1e308 parses as the identifier e308), so
